# Distributed query with WHERE clause - expect index usage with filters detected
Expression (Project names)
  Limit (preliminary LIMIT)
    Sorting (Merge sorted streams after aggregation stage for ORDER BY)
      Union
        Limit (preliminary LIMIT (with OFFSET))
          Sorting (Sorting for ORDER BY)
            Expression ((Before ORDER BY + Projection))
              Filter ((WHERE + Change column names to column identifiers))
                ReadFromMergeTree (default.tab_local)
                Indexes:
                  PrimaryKey
                    Keys:
                      id
                    Condition: (id in [4, +Inf))
                    Parts: 1/1
                    Granules: 4/4
                    Search Algorithm: binary search
                  Skip
                    Name: idx
                    Description: vector_similarity GRANULARITY 2
                    Parts: 1/1
                    Granules: 2/4
                  Ranges: 2
        ReadFromRemote (Read from remote replica)
