    Sorting (Merge sorted streams after aggregation stage for ORDER BY)
      Union
        Expression ((Before ORDER BY + (Projection + Change column names to column identifiers)) [lifted up part])
          Limit (preliminary LIMIT (with OFFSET))
            Sorting (Sorting for ORDER BY)
              Expression ((Before ORDER BY + (Projection + Change column names to column identifiers)))
                ReadFromMergeTree (default.tab_local)
                Indexes:
                  PrimaryKey
                    Condition: true
                    Parts: 1/1
                    Granules: 4/4
                  Ranges: 1
        ReadFromRemote (Read from remote replica)
